5.5 Classic mistakes to avoid

Vague objectives (no observable criterion);
Overly ambitious sequencing (underestimating time);
Missing evidence (“I will read the docs”);
A “perfect” plan never revisited after session 5; the plan is a living tool, you update it (and document why) in the logbook.
